# This directory holds machine specific state produced at runtime.
#   root.json           the resolved workspace root and drive letter of the
#                       last run. A mismatch with the current root is what
#                       triggers the relocation repair routine.
#   leak-baseline.json  snapshot of external cache sizes, written by
#                       ws-doctor.ps1 -Baseline.
# The files are intentionally git-ignored because their content is per machine.
